{{> studentTop}}
<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR EFFORT, RECOGNISED</p><h1>My achievements</h1><p class="muted">Each completed course keeps its badge and certificate together.</p></div></div><div class="notice info">Earn a badge and certificate when you meet the published course completion rules. Download the certificate PDF here; the badge is displayed beside it. Direct source citations are not an eligibility requirement. Stars reflect the final score: 75–84% = 1, 85–94% = 2, 95–100% = 3.</div>
{{#if pendingAwards}}<section class="card space-top"><h2>Completed courses awaiting certificate setup</h2><p class="small muted">Your course completion is saved. A certificate is issued automatically when all published course requirements are met.</p>{{#each pendingAwards}}<p class="assignment-item"><strong>{{title}}</strong><span>Completed {{date}} · eligibility check pending</span></p>{{/each}}</section>{{/if}}<div class="grid cols-3 space-top">{{#each credentials}}<article class="card achievement"><div class="award-pair"><div class="award-tile"><span class="chip">Badge</span><div class="award-badge" aria-hidden="true">🏅</div><strong>{{badgeLabel}}</strong><span class="stars" aria-label="{{stars}} stars">{{starsText}}</span></div><div class="award-tile"><span class="chip">Certificate</span><div class="award-certificate" aria-hidden="true">▤</div><strong>Course completion</strong><small>Faculty &amp; Campus Administrator signatures</small></div></div><h2 class="space-top">{{courseTitle}}</h2><p class="small muted">Awarded to {{recipientName}}<br>{{date}} · Course version {{courseVersion}}<br>Final assessment: {{score}}%</p><div class="stack space-top"><a class="button full" href="/student/credentials/{{id}}/certificate">Download certificate · PDF ↓</a><a class="small" href="/verify/{{id}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View credential verification ↗</a></div><p class="small muted space-top">Share the verification link only if you want others to see your name and course completion.</p></article>{{else}}{{#unless pendingAwards}}<section class="card empty"><strong>Your first achievement is ahead.</strong>Complete all requirements, pass the final assessment and meet the published course requirements to earn your certificate and badge.<br><a class="button" href="/student/courses">Explore courses →</a></section>{{/unless}}{{/each}}</div>
<section class="card space-top"><h2>Completion & improvement history</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Course</th><th>First / latest completion</th><th>Passed completions</th><th>Repeat completions</th><th>Latest / best final knowledge score</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{#each completionHistory}}<tr><td>{{title}}</td><td>{{first}}<small>{{latest}}</small></td><td>{{completions}}</td><td>{{repeats}}</td><td>{{latestScore}}% / {{best}}%</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="5" class="empty">Complete your first course to start your history.</td></tr>{{/each}}</tbody></table></div></section><section class="card space-top"><h2>Published award criteria</h2><p>1 star: course passing score to 84% · 2 stars: 85–94% · 3 stars: 95–100%. Practical courses use the published weighted grade. A course can be completed once; after that, you can review it but cannot start another attempt.</p></section>{{> studentBottom}}

